# Generative AI Interview Notes — Fine-tuning (LoRA/QLoRA) + RLHF/DPO + Hallucination/Guardrails + Eval + Agents/Tools

> Goal: interview-ready end-to-end notes for **applied GenAI / LLM engineering**.
> DS-friendly: every concept is explained in simple lines and then in technical depth.

