## 0) Where these topics fit in GenAI stack

### You typically have 3 ways to improve LLM results

1. **Prompting** (fastest)
2. **RAG** (add external knowledge)
3. **Fine-tuning** (change model behavior)

And to make the system production-ready:

* guardrails/safety
* evaluation + monitoring
* agents/tools integration

✅ Interview line:

> “Prompting and RAG improve answers; fine-tuning changes the model itself; guardrails + eval make it production-grade.”

